{"slug":"greetings-starter-l9","artistFeel":null,"beat":"Chill Slow","data":{"title":"Greetings & Conversation — Starter · Lesson 9","subject":"greetings","subjectLabel":"Greetings & Conversation","level":"starter","lesson":9,"totalLessons":20,"genre":"Blues","lyrics":"Here we go\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's talk… Vamos a hablar\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nIt's good to hear your voice.\n\n[Verse]\nGood morning… Buenos días\nI hope you're doing fine.\nThank you… Gracias\nFor picking up the phone this time.\nNice to meet you… Encantado\nThat's what I want to say.\nBye… Adiós\nBut not for long today.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's talk… Vamos a hablar\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nIt's good to hear your voice.\n\n[Verse]\nExcuse me… Perdona\nIf I need to interrupt.\nOf course… Claro\nI know you're in the middle of a chat.\nTell me… Cuéntame\nAbout your day, I want to know.\nCome on… Venga\nShare with me, let it flow.\n\n[Bridge]\nWell… Bueno\nThat's good to hear.\nOkay… Vale\nI'm glad you're near.\nTrue… Cierto\nIs what you say.\nCome on… Venga\nLet's talk more today.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's talk… Vamos a hablar\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nIt's good to hear your voice.\n\n[Outro]","vocab":[{"es":"encantado","en":"nice to meet you"},{"es":"adiós","en":"bye"},{"es":"perdona","en":"excuse me"},{"es":"gracias","en":"thank you"},{"es":"bueno","en":"well"},{"es":"vale","en":"okay"},{"es":"claro","en":"of course"},{"es":"cuéntame","en":"tell me"},{"es":"cierto","en":"true"},{"es":"venga","en":"come on"},{"es":"¿conoces?","en":"do you know"},{"es":"oye","en":"hey"},{"es":"espera","en":"wait"},{"es":"mira","en":"look"},{"es":"perfecto","en":"perfect"}]},"timings":[{"start":0.12,"end":0.291,"loss":4.463448660714286},{"start":0.291,"end":2.14,"loss":6.223562240600586},{"start":2.14,"end":5.26,"loss":2.8785757093718556},{"start":5.26,"end":7.54,"loss":2.6134684880574546},{"sta